    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Issue VR is one of the best Trickshot challenge game in the Virtual space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, it's not enough to just aim and throw - you need to think carefully about every move, as the ball's path, speed and interaction with surfaces is determined by realistic physics simulation. Your goal is simple: throw the ball so that it bounces off all objects and hits the target perfectly. But this challenge goes far beyond ordinary skill games, as each track is a unique puzzle that requires logic, strategy and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unique Levels</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creative Mode </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Custom Maps</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RULE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464960/extras/e890af4633e17d28880f91b18047a575.avif?t=1747645295\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are required to use all the objects on the shelves to solve each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD THE TRACK IN ANYWAY YOU WANT!</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464960/extras/050021183bf8d212e04c054db0e22204.avif?t=1747645295\" data-has-big width=800 height=304 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level contains  optional items that you can use to make your course more exciting. The more complex your course is, the more points your solution will earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are you skilled enough?<br><br><br><br>Do you have any ideas to make the game better ? <br>Join our discord server!<br><br></i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Issue VR is one of the best Trickshot challenge game in the Virtual space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, it's not enough to just aim and throw - you need to think carefully about every move, as the ball's path, speed and interaction with surfaces is determined by realistic physics simulation. Your goal is simple: throw the ball so that it bounces off all objects and hits the target perfectly. But this challenge goes far beyond ordinary skill games, as each track is a unique puzzle that requires logic, strategy and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unique Levels</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creative Mode </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Custom Maps</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RULE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464960/extras/e890af4633e17d28880f91b18047a575.avif?t=1747645295\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are required to use all the objects on the shelves to solve each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD THE TRACK IN ANYWAY YOU WANT!</strong> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464960/extras/050021183bf8d212e04c054db0e22204.avif?t=1747645295\" data-has-big width=800 height=304 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level contains  optional items that you can use to make your course more exciting. The more complex your course is, the more points your solution will earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are you skilled enough?<br><br><br><br>Do you have any ideas to make the game better ? <br>Join our discord server!<br><br></i></strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Imagine entering a virtual world where physics and skill meet in a fun challenge! The aim of the game is simple, yet incredibly addictive: throw the ball so that it bounces over all the placed objects and finally hits the target. It's up to you to plan the route and execute the perfect throw.",
